    "detailed_description": "A story-rich, psychological-horror adventure game. <strong>Play as a modern witch with psychic abilities</strong> and delve into the mysteries of a world inspired by the work of Neil Gaiman and Stephen King.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457500/extras/96c594b36488d17644403cb27749e2f7.poster.avif?t=1718145472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457500/extras/96c594b36488d17644403cb27749e2f7.webm?t=1718145472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457500/extras/96c594b36488d17644403cb27749e2f7.mp4?t=1718145472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your friend went mysteriourly missing. You need to follow her trail, search for clues and explore haunted places. Little by little you\u2019ll find that you\u2019re not the hunter: you're actually the <i>prey</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457500/extras/377da787315eb510ee48a4537c4260ab.poster.avif?t=1718145472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457500/extras/377da787315eb510ee48a4537c4260ab.webm?t=1718145472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457500/extras/377da787315eb510ee48a4537c4260ab.mp4?t=1718145472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some interesting features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Perform powerful witch rituals and spells<br></li><li>Use a ouija board (we advice against it, though!)<br></li><li>Read the Tarot cards<br></li><li>Play as a cat for a little while<br></li><li>Unravel the secrets of a story of epic proportions, trying to put together a puzzle where pieces don't seem to fit quite right</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "A story-rich, psychological-horror adventure game. <strong>Play as a modern witch with psychic abilities</strong> and delve into the mysteries of a world inspired by the work of Neil Gaiman and Stephen King.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457500/extras/96c594b36488d17644403cb27749e2f7.poster.avif?t=1718145472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457500/extras/96c594b36488d17644403cb27749e2f7.webm?t=1718145472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457500/extras/96c594b36488d17644403cb27749e2f7.mp4?t=1718145472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your friend went mysteriourly missing. You need to follow her trail, search for clues and explore haunted places. Little by little you\u2019ll find that you\u2019re not the hunter: you're actually the <i>prey</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457500/extras/377da787315eb510ee48a4537c4260ab.poster.avif?t=1718145472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457500/extras/377da787315eb510ee48a4537c4260ab.webm?t=1718145472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457500/extras/377da787315eb510ee48a4537c4260ab.mp4?t=1718145472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some interesting features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Perform powerful witch rituals and spells<br></li><li>Use a ouija board (we advice against it, though!)<br></li><li>Read the Tarot cards<br></li><li>Play as a cat for a little while<br></li><li>Unravel the secrets of a story of epic proportions, trying to put 